            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trapped in Limbo DLC is included in the Atomic Pass. Requires the base game Atomic Heart to run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue the story by diving back into the mad world of Limbo! Get through a combat extravaganza and Limbo-flavored challenges to learn P-3’s fate. Experience the contrast of worlds with unconventional mechanics selected to blow you away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trapped in Limbo DLC features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tContinuation of the story in new sections of the twisted Limbo world, meticulously created by the brilliant mind of Artem Galeev, Art Director of the Mundfish studio. Help P-3 to break free and, this time, explore what happens after the different ending of the main campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tInsane gameplay with new rules packed into the Limbo-flavored favorite challenges. Run, jump, slide across platforms and fight bizarre enemies in a combat extravaganza.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tMarvelously-looking weapons and skills to earn as you collect apples and coins, progressing through the depth of P-3’s mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tUp to 7 unique weapon skins for P-3 to unlock, which you can equip in the Atomic Heart’s main campaign.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trapped in Limbo DLC is included in the Atomic Pass. Requires the base game Atomic Heart to run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue the story by diving back into the mad world of Limbo! Get through a combat extravaganza and Limbo-flavored challenges to learn P-3’s fate. Experience the contrast of worlds with unconventional mechanics selected to blow you away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trapped in Limbo DLC features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tContinuation of the story in new sections of the twisted Limbo world, meticulously created by the brilliant mind of Artem Galeev, Art Director of the Mundfish studio. Help P-3 to break free and, this time, explore what happens after the different ending of the main campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tInsane gameplay with new rules packed into the Limbo-flavored favorite challenges. Run, jump, slide across platforms and fight bizarre enemies in a combat extravaganza.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tMarvelously-looking weapons and skills to earn as you collect apples and coins, progressing through the depth of P-3’s mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tUp to 7 unique weapon skins for P-3 to unlock, which you can equip in the Atomic Heart’s main campaign.</p>",
